meta {
  name: detail
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/usulan-penelitian/detail?id={{proposal_id}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

params:query {
  id: {{proposal_id}}
}

docs {
  # Get Detail Usulan Penelitian
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/usulan-penelitian/detail`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ✅ | ID usulan penelitian |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil detail usulan",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "judul": "Pengembangan AI",
      "abstrak": "Deskripsi penelitian...",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tipe_usulan": "penelitian",
      "file_proposal": "/uploads/proposals/file.pdf",
      "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z",
      "ketua": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "name": "Dr. Ahmad",
        "email": "ahmad@univ.ac.id"
      },
      "anggota": [
        {
          "id": "uuid",
          "user_id": "uuid",
          "peran": "Anggota",
          "user": {
            "name": "Dr. Budi"
          }
        }
      ],
      "tahunAkademik": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "tahun": "2024/2025"
      },
      "hibahInternal": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "nama": "Hibah Dikti"
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 400 | ID wajib diisi |
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 404 | Usulan tidak ditemukan |
}
